Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.75,0:00:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.63,0:00:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.29,0:00:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.95,0:01:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, uh, welcome back, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What an unexpected surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.95,0:01:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure it is,\Nyou treacherous snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,0:01:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know all about your\Npartnership with Pegasus
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.35,0:01:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and the scheme you had to\Ntake over my corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.81,0:01:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.83,0:01:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What you guys did was really messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.59,0:01:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuba...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.50,0:01:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Working with that creep to try\Nand get rid of my brother and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.01,0:01:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.87,0:01:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.27,0:01:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and I suggest you leave\Nnow before I really
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.91,0:01:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,lose my temper and take\Nmore than just your jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But let us explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.97,0:01:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't test me, you slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.73,0:01:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, if you simply let us speak, you'll\Nunderstand why we did what we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.31,0:01:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That I doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The sole reason we formed this\Nso-called partnership with Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.21,0:01:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.35,0:01:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, was to rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.79,0:01:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Johnson here is absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.17,0:01:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus was the one who\Nwanted your company,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.77,0:02:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and we thought that perhaps if we had\Nsome sort of phony alliance with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.17,0:02:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,it would lead us to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.55,0:02:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You expect us to believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, we had no intention\Nof taking over Kyber Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.43,0:02:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.34,0:02:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we've been waiting for your stamp of approval\Nbefore we sent out our latest product.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.23,0:02:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your VirtuaPod.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.73,0:02:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We've readied it for market distribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.11,0:02:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You have?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.02,0:02:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.93,0:02:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't think that that\Nmeans you're off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, Mokuba, my virtual\Nadventure game is ready to be tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.23,0:02:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You just got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to try it out right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.57,0:02:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry about it, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But it could be a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're forgetting, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.81,0:02:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I designed each and every\Nprogram in this game myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.69,0:02:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how long I've been\Nwaiting for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.93,0:03:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.61,0:03:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.53,0:03:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's finished at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.45,0:03:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Insert dueling deck into\Nthe drive recognizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All systems go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.31,0:03:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Virtua screen closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.29,0:03:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Virtua screen locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.79,0:03:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Reality uplink loading.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.67,0:03:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother, are you positive\Nabout this? Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.59,0:03:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now start it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be long, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.53,0:03:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I hope he knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:03:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This mine transport portal\Nhas certainly been smoothed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.05,0:04:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,out I can hardly even feel the\Nseparation from my body Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.09,0:04:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,let's see how the virtual world itself is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.23,0:04:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Visuals, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.23,0:04:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Life points, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.27,0:04:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.97,0:04:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.69,0:04:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I programmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.35,0:04:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon the Blue-Eyes White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,White lightning attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The armed ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.31,0:05:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't design this. Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.03,0:05:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.59,0:05:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A dragon capture jar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.07,0:05:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone must have reprogrammed\Nthe game's combat protocols!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.03,0:05:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My blue eyes! No! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.59,0:05:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong! Settle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.49,0:05:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:05:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother's obsession with technology\Nhas always been his greatest weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.07,0:06:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto should have heeded\Nyour warning, little Mokuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.67,0:06:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But now it's too late and his mind\Nis imprisoned in his own game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.49,0:06:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thanks to a few technical\Nmodifications we've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And with you our prisoner once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.89,0:06:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,there'll be no one to stop\Nus from taking over Kaibokor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.83,0:06:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter the access code.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd that brat go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He went through the ventilator shaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.71,0:06:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid thinks fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.53,0:06:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba's escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What escaped?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, find him, you idiot. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.95,0:06:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have to find little Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.49,0:06:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll come back to us soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.71,0:06:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we have his brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.51,0:06:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and if Mokuba wants to save him,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.35,0:07:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the only way is to use the Virtuopod\Nand beat the game he's trapped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.93,0:07:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A scenario that I assure\Nyou is quite unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.19,0:07:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Put it on my tab, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tab's past due, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.77,0:07:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then put it on Tristan's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.11,0:07:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.21,0:07:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please help me, Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying the only way Kaiba\Ncan escape is by winning the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But if those creeps reprogram the entire\Nadventure just to keep Kaiba trapped there,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.21,0:07:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,how is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.65,0:07:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.39,0:07:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.85,0:07:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.17,0:07:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We will, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.43,0:07:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell us some more about this\NVirtuopod your brother was designing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.77,0:07:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I was pretty young when he started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember him spending endless\Nhours working on the prototypes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.69,0:07:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to make it perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.89,0:07:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Prototypes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So there are other ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. In his lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.17,0:08:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my brother's dream to create the\Nworld's ultimate virtual adventure land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But those corporate jerks\Nturned it into a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Lousy suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll show them like we did Pegasus. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll use those Pog prototypes, go to\Nthat virtual world and rescue Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be back soon, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You be careful. We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.57,0:08:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys don't even know the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.21,0:08:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when I think I can't be\Nany prouder of those four kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.37,0:08:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's personal laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't like anyone messing around in\Nhere, but I used to sneak in all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.19,0:08:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where Seto keeps\Nhis most secret stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the prototypes? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.43,0:09:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, just like the model my brother's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.31,0:09:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Only three pods.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess someone's staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.57,0:09:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I say Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And I say you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.49,0:09:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.41,0:09:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Koopa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.69,0:09:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who knows\Nhow to work these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You should stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.05,0:09:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.96,0:09:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but I also know the most about the virtual\Nadventure land that we're going into.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.61,0:09:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point. So then get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.79,0:09:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of my gorgeous bod, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys had better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.81,0:09:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine, Paya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't you worry about a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.09,0:09:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have Kaiba rescued in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, let her rip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Virtual upload now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.37,0:10:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the Kaiba Labs building.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.35,0:10:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Mokuba came back\Njust like I said he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.03,0:10:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but he brought Yukimoto\Nand those others with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Kimo goes down there and unplugs those\Npods, they'll have no way of returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I've got my dueling deck with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but this life point count\Nmakes me a bit nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.73,0:10:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know what happens in a\Nvideo game when you lose a life,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.57,0:10:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but I wonder what happens here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of a scary thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.95,0:10:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No joke, Uke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, speaking of scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.59,0:10:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe all of\Nthis is virtual and not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, it looks\Nplenty real enough to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.41,0:10:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, zombie alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.59,0:11:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,These zombies are nothing\Nbut dual monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.93,0:11:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I just draw a card, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.73,0:11:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I really don't know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.97,0:11:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon the Rude Kaiser!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.63,0:11:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And I summon the Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.31,0:11:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.13,0:11:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how you do it in Virtual World.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.95,0:11:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.23,0:11:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon the Flame Swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:11:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Flaming Sword of Battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.29,0:12:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cancel your Flame Swordsman's attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.65,0:12:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.67,0:12:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Got dragons reforming again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.25,0:12:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time we slay one of these zombie\Nmonsters, they come back even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.15,0:12:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter how strong their attacks\Nget, they still have one major weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.65,0:12:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think about it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you've defeated them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombies have zero defense power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.81,0:12:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So by activating shield and sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.85,0:12:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can reverse their attack and defense\Npoints so their attack becomes zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.43,0:12:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, they're all yours, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Dark Magic Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.63,0:13:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.69,0:13:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.79,0:13:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be part of some\Nkind of scoring system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.99,0:13:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my life points aren't going back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.15,0:13:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That sure can't be good, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I guess these virtual monsters\Nare playing for keeps, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.47,0:13:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.81,0:13:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.72,0:13:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it's one of them fairies that they\Nput in these games to help the players out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, let's follow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.65,0:13:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That slippery little Sprite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.83,0:13:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.21,0:13:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but I think I found what\Nit was trying to show us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.27,0:13:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's an entire virtual town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go explore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.89,0:14:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm glad we all\Nate before we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.95,0:14:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.27,0:14:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this might come in handy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.31,0:14:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that it works that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.55,0:14:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.55,0:14:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,2,000 points?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.69,0:14:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well, we must have scored at\Nleast that many from those zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.89,0:14:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Five?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, let's concentrate\Non finding my brother first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.91,0:14:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.37,0:14:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's split up and comb\Nthis town for clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.89,0:14:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Search every street.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Question every virtual person you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.57,0:14:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody must have spotted him or know\Nsomething about what happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.43,0:14:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, somewhere, can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the way these games work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,When we're done, let's meet\Nback at the water fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Joey, did you find out anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.63,0:14:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I found out I hate virtual dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.53,0:14:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, I got a great lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,See that mountain? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.53,0:14:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,an old woman I was talking\Nto said that she saw
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.07,0:15:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,a man with a prisoner\Nheaded there this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Supposedly, there's some kind\Nof ancient temple at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And the only way to get there\Nis by crossing this desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.81,0:15:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.73,0:15:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So where's our ride out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.01,0:15:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, us includes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.87,0:15:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta hand it to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.01,0:15:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This virtual sand, it\Ntastes just like real sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.79,0:15:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.95,0:15:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.35,0:15:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.01,0:15:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sand twister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.69,0:15:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming right towards us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you, wake up, pal. We're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.15,0:15:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.37,0:15:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That sand twister blew us back into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it shook the\Nlittle guy up a bit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That ain't no way to\Nbe crossing no desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.33,0:16:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you saying you\Nknow how to cross it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.11,0:16:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not me who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's them desert-crossing\Nnuatory chickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Them what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean the nuatory\Ncard. Thanks, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you please tell us where\Nwe could go to get a card?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.95,0:16:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could, but they can't be gotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.83,0:16:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They can only be won.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.19,0:16:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, man, this guy's an odd bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You say prized bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.03,0:16:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is, especially around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't figure out what\Nhe's trying to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.63,0:16:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe one of the card stands\Nwe saw on the way in has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.19,0:16:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.13,0:16:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.57,0:16:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There certainly are plenty\Nof card stands in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.09,0:16:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely one of them has to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.01,0:16:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's private lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's just a matter of\Npulling the plug on those brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.57,0:16:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been gone a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:16:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:16:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.61,0:17:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I once saw Joy play a video game for three
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.17,0:17:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,days straight without blinking or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.89,0:17:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.65,0:17:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, I know what'll make all\Nthis waiting around go by faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.01,0:17:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's called Guess My Facial Hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.47,0:17:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you haven't\Nnoticed my fine beard growing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.13,0:17:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got like eight whiskers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.95,0:17:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take a feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.15,0:17:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just go and\Ntake a nap in the corner? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.67,0:17:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll get a bonus for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks to me like we've got\Nsome company headed our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, let's lock the door and set up\Nsome kind of barricade to hold them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.13,0:17:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.73,0:17:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.35,0:17:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We checked every stand in town, and\Nnot one of them has that new Atori car.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.67,0:17:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder it's such a\Nprized bird around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.33,0:17:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, prized? That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.45,0:17:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.61,0:18:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what the old man meant! Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an announcement of a contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.43,0:18:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fame, glory,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and the prized Niwatori card await the\Nheroic warrior who can beat our champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Signed, the Grand Battle Chief and\NCombat Outfitter of Shadow Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.11,0:18:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.02,0:18:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's sign up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.07,0:18:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I always wanted to be a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.53,0:18:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,One of you as a Coliseum warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.37,0:18:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This city takes its gladiator\Nmatches quite seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.43,0:18:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's a shot at\Nthe champion you desire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.37,0:18:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,One moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Far be it from me to standing your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.45,0:18:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, your battle mask and combat cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.13,0:18:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, is all this stuff really necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, if you're going to lose all your life\Npoints, you may as well look like a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.01,0:18:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All of my life points?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.49,0:18:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Give that stuff to me, Hugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:19:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you risk all\Nyour life points for this, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.59,0:19:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight there, champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But Joey, you already have less\Nlife points than both Mokuba and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.65,0:19:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.65,0:19:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, looks like I'm just gonna\Nhave to be extra careful then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.47,0:19:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But so will the champ once he\Nsees the skills that I have. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.39,0:19:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.73,0:19:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Being a hero is what I do best. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on! Let's see it! Let's see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.09,0:19:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.91,0:19:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,we have at last found the soul brave\Nenough to challenge our champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.39,0:19:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I present to you the purveyor of\Nboundings, the picture of pugnacity,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,the pig that backs a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.55,0:19:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Introducing the challenger\Nthat I've got, Senor Barty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.73,0:19:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,More like Senor Dorky to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No joke, the champ will have\Na field day with this oinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.01,0:19:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than being called a lap dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.01,0:19:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:19:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:20:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, introducing our undefeated champ,\Nthe monarch of mayhem, the queen of fiend,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Madame Butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.41,0:20:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.39,0:20:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The champion's a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.25,0:20:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And from the looks of it,\Nshe's ready to rumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Roast that pig!
